  checkPresenceHeader?: string(name='CheckPresenceHeader', description='Specifies headers whose presence is checked when generating a cache key. If a specified header exists in the request, its name (case-insensitive) is added to the cache key. Separate multiple header names with spaces. Header names can contain the following characters:

- Symbols: ! # $ % & \\\\" \\\\* + - . ^ _ | \\\\~

